IP Geolocation by DB-IP (https://db-ip.com)

The image carries DB-IP's "IP to Country Lite" database
(dbip-country-lite.mmdb), downloaded when the image is built. DB-IP
licenses it under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
License (CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The admin panel shows this attribution wherever it shows countries.
